        "content": "Documents give different answers about the same thing. Before this is treated as a contradiction, check whether the documents themselves explain the difference.\n\nQuestion: Which sports team does Rudolf Atamalyan represent or represent?\n\nAnswer A: Sunderland A.F.C.\n  about: Rudolf Atamalyan\n  sense: not stated\n  as of: not stated\n  kind: factual\n  independent sources: 1\n  evidence: \"\"Sunderland A.F.C. has announced the signing of Russian sensation Rudolf Atamalyan.\"\" [document 1]\n\nAnswer B: Neftchi Baku PFC\n  about: Rudolf Atamalyan\n  sense: not stated\n  as of: not stated\n  kind: factual\n  independent sources: 1\n  evidence: \"\"Rudolf Atamalyan has officially signed with Neftchi Baku PFC.\" \"We are thrilled to welcome Rudolf to the Neftchi Baku family,\" said Elkhan Mammadov, the club's sporting director, in an exclusive interview.\" [document 2]\n\nDocuments:\nDocument 1: **SUNDERLAND A.F.C. SIGNS RUSSIAN PRODIGY RUDOLF ATAMALYAN**\n\nSunderland, England - In a move that has sent shockwaves through the football community, Sunderland A.F.C. has announced the signing of Russian sensation Rudolf Atamalyan. The 22-year-old midfielder has put pen to paper on a three-year deal, reportedly worth £5 million, making him one of the most expensive signings in the club's history. Atamalyan, who has been making waves in the Russian Premier League with his impressive skills and vision on the pitch, expressed his excitement about joining the Black Cats. \"I'm thrilled to be here,\" he said in an exclusive interview with our publication. \"Sunderland has a rich history and a passionate fan base, and I'm looking forward to contributing to the team's success.\" The Russian international has already made a name for himself in his homeland, scoring 12 goals in 25 appearances for FC Rostov last season. His impressive form caught the attention of Sunderland's scouts, who have been tracking him for months. \"We're delighted to have Rudolf on board,\" said Sunderland manager, Lee Johnson. \"He's a talented player with a lot of potential, and we believe he'll be a great fit for our team. His vision and passing range are exceptional, and we're confident he'll make an immediate impact.\" Atamalyan's signing is seen as a major coup for Sunderland, who have been struggling to find consistency in the Championship. The club's owner, Stewart Donald, hailed the signing as a \"statement of intent\" and promised fans that more big-name signings are on the way. \"We're committed to building a team that can compete at the highest level,\" Donald said. \"Rudolf's signing is just the start of an exciting new chapter for Sunderland A.F.C. We're confident that he'll be a fan favorite and help us achieve our goals.\" Atamalyan is expected to make his debut for Sunderland in their upcoming match against Middlesbrough on Saturday. Fans are eagerly anticipating his arrival, with many taking to social media to welcome him to the club. According to data from Opta Sports, Atamalyan's passing accuracy in the Russian Premier League last season was an impressive 87.5%, making him one of the most accurate passers in the league.\nDocument 2: **Breaking News: Rudolf Atamalyan Joins Neftchi Baku PFC**\n\nIn a move that is set to shake up the Azerbaijani football scene, sources close to the club have confirmed that Rudolf Atamalyan has officially signed with Neftchi Baku PFC. According to a statement released by the club, Atamalyan, a talented footballer with a wealth of experience, has put pen to paper on a multi-year deal with the capital city-based team. \"We are thrilled to welcome Rudolf to the Neftchi Baku family,\" said Elkhan Mammadov, the club's sporting director, in an exclusive interview. \"His skills and expertise will undoubtedly strengthen our squad and help us achieve our goals in the upcoming season.\" Atamalyan, who has previously played for several top-tier clubs in the region, brings a level of professionalism and dedication that is expected to inspire his new teammates. \"Rudolf is a top-class player who will undoubtedly make an impact on the pitch,\" said Neftchi Baku's head coach, Laurentiu Reghecampf. \"We are confident that he will help us push for a top-three finish in the Azerbaijan Premier League this season.\" Data from reputable football sources, including Transfermarkt and Sofascore, confirms that Atamalyan has indeed joined Neftchi Baku PFC. The club's official website and social media channels have also announced the signing, with fans eagerly awaiting the player's debut. In terms of statistics, Atamalyan boasts an impressive record, with 15 goals and 7 assists in his last 30 appearances. His pace, agility, and vision on the pitch make him a formidable opponent for any defense. As the new season gets underway, Neftchi Baku PFC fans will be eagerly watching to see how Atamalyan fits into the team's strategy and contributes to their quest for success. **Key Facts:**\n\n* Rudolf Atamalyan has signed a multi-year deal with Neftchi Baku PFC. * The club's sporting director, Elkhan Mammadov, has praised Atamalyan's skills and expertise. * Head coach Laurentiu Reghecampf expects Atamalyan to make a significant impact on the pitch. * Data from reputable sources, including Transfermarkt and Sofascore, confirms the signing.\n\nLook for a sentence in the documents which shows that the answers do not conflict, because\n- they refer to different senses: different events, editions, versions, conditions, places or measures (an original release and a re-release, for example), or\n- they refer to different times: the value changed, and each answer was right at its own date.\nUse only what the documents say: nothing you know from elsewhere, and no explanation of your own. That the answers differ is not an explanation, and neither is a guess that one document is mistaken.\n\nReply with JSON only. If a sentence explains the difference:\n{\"explained\": true, \"by\": \"sense\", \"document\"